Chapter: ProseBinaryContinuation

Section: Left

  left : Integer -> Integer
  left (n) =
   n + 1

 Prose between the left operand and the operator.
   + 1000

Section: Right

  right : Integer -> Integer
  right (n) =
   n +
 Prose between the operator and the right operand.
   1000

Section: Precedence

  mixed : Integer -> Integer
  mixed (n) =
   n * 2

 Prose after a tighter expression.


   + 3

Section: Entry

  opening : Integer = left 1 + right 1 + mixed 1
